---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Design Services"
  description="Logo design, brand identity systems, and print-ready file prep for signs, wraps, and everything in between. Oh! Signs."
>
  <section class="page-hero section-y">
    <div class="container">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Design Services</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-h1" style="color: var(--color-cream); margin: 1rem 0;">Design Services.</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-body">
        Great printing starts with great art. We do original design, brand systems,
        and production-ready file prep — so nothing goes to press looking wrong.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/quote" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Design Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="design-offerings section-cream section-y">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="text-h2" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">What we offer.</h2>
      <div class="offerings-grid">
        <div class="offering">
          <h3 class="text-h3">Logo Design</h3>
          <p>Original mark or wordmark, delivered in all standard formats (AI, EPS, SVG, PNG). Includes a usage guide so your logo stays consistent everywhere it appears.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offering">
          <h3 class="text-h3">Brand Identity</h3>
          <p>Logo plus colour system, type pairing, and basic brand guidelines. Priced by scope — small businesses to full commercial rollouts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offering">
          <h3 class="text-h3">Signage Layout & Artwork</h3>
          <p>We'll take your logo and copy and design a sign that actually works at scale. We know what reads from 10 feet and what disappears.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offering">
          <h3 class="text-h3">Vehicle Wrap Design</h3>
          <p>Designing for a 3D surface is different from print. We work with your vehicle template and artwork to make sure it wraps correctly — no mirror-flip logos, no stretched text.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offering">
          <h3 class="text-h3">File Prep & Cleanup</h3>
          <p>Already have a logo but it's a low-res JPG from 2009? We vectorise, clean up, and prep it for production. Flat fee, fast turnaround.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offering">
          <h3 class="text-h3">Retouching & Modifications</h3>
          <p>Need to update an existing design? Add a year, swap a tagline, adjust a colour? We handle small revisions quickly without charging for a whole new design.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="design-process section-y">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="text-h2" style="color: var(--color-cream); margin-bottom: 2rem;">The process.</h2>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="step-n">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-h3" style="color: var(--color-cream);">Brief</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-smoke);">Tell us what the business does, who it's for, and what feeling you're going for. The more detail, the better the first round.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="step-n">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-h3" style="color: var(--color-cream);">Concepts</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-smoke);">We deliver initial concepts. Logo projects typically include 2–3 directions. You pick one to develop.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="step-n">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-h3" style="color: var(--color-cream);">Revisions</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-smoke);">Two rounds of revisions are included. Additional rounds at an hourly rate. Most projects wrap in two.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="step-n">04</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-h3" style="color: var(--color-cream);">Final files</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-smoke);">We deliver production-ready files — and answer questions about how to use them going forward.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/quote" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">Start a Design Project</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero { background-color: var(--color-ink); }
  .page-hero-body { color: var(--color-smoke); max-width: 54ch; margin: 0; }

  .breadcrumb { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-smoke); }
  .breadcrumb a { color: var(--color-smoke); transition: color var(--duration-fast); }
  .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--color-cream); }
  .breadcrumb span[aria-current] { color: var(--color-cream); }

  .design-offerings { background-color: var(--color-cream); color: var(--color-ink); }
  .offerings-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .offering {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(14,15,12,0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .offering h3 { margin: 0; }
  .offering p  { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: #5a6050; }

  .design-process { background-color: var(--color-ink); }
  .process-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 640px; }
  .process-step { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start; }
  .step-n {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-acid);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(184,230,0,0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .process-step div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.375rem; }
  .process-step h3 { margin: 0; }
  .process-step p  { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) { .offerings-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .offerings-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
